<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia ASB six-mth net up fourfold.</title>
<headline>Malaysia ASB six-mth net up fourfold.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   8.61   vs	   2.07</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  2.76   vs	   1.09</p>
<p>    Turnover		   337.02   vs	  91.43</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    51.43   vs	   7.31</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less 19.47   vs  less   2.19</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    (78)   vs	    -</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	  -     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Advance Synergy Bhd. Its main activties are in property development, timber trading and product manufacturing.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
